  "rationale": "The Pareto front is well-mapped and dominated by the iterative family, which provides the minimum area (7101 um^2) while satisfying the throughput constraint (8.32 MSPS >= 1) and the accuracy constraint (max_abs_err 0.000865 <= 0.000976562). The front spans a reasonable range of accuracy bits (10.2 to 13.8) and area (7101 to 8898 um^2). Other families (unrolled_k, pipelined, pipelined_m) have significantly higher areas (15134, 32426, 19348 um^2 respectively) and do not offer better trade-offs for the 'min area' objective. Since this is the final round and the iterative family clearly dominates the feasible space for the primary objective of minimizing area, no further exploration is needed.",
